          "create_time": 1794518882.468,
          "update_time": 1794518888.309,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "I obtained a useful **signed real-quadratic estimate**:\n\\[\n|\\operatorname{Re}\\mathcal S_{Z,N_U}|\n\\ll(1+\\log U)^3\\left(U^{-1/9}+\\frac{U^{37/180}}{\\ell}\\right),\n\\qquad Z=\\lfloor U^{1/3}\\rfloor.\n\\]\n\nWith \\(M,Y\\asymp U^{1/10}\\), the complete error budget improves the window exponent from **\\(17/72\\) to \\(17/81\\)**. The residual power remainder is\n\\[\nO_\\rho\\!\\left(U^{-\\min(7/6480,\\;9\\rho/28)}\\right).\n\\]\nThe existing logarithmic residual and Green-mean rates are preserved.\n\nThe [research note](/Users/ebbaker/Documents/shifted-zeta-positivity/papers/investigations-5/09_green_potentials_newman_flow/01_riemann_siegel_evolution/notes/29_GNP_RS_B10_SIGNED_MELLIN_MEAN_ESTIMATE_20261112.md) includes cutoff, Mellin-tail, pole, parameter and collision-control checks. **This has same-assistant checking only**, using published and inherited inputs.\n\nProgress and chat history are updated. The [continuation note](/Users/ebbaker/Documents/shifted-zeta-positivity/papers/investigations-5/09_green_potentials_newman_flow/01_riemann_siegel_evolution/notes/30_GNP_RS_B10_RETURN_AND_MODEL_CHANGE_20261112.md) recommends **[GPT-6.1 Sol](https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-6.1-sol)** for a fresh proof audit before manuscript integration.\n\nThe remaining conceptual issue for brainstorming is persistence: a localized positive Green defect can still fit inside this averaged bound. No every-center estimate follows yet."
            ]
